From {{inh|en|enm|tor}}, {{m|enm|tore}}, {{m|enm|toor}}, from {{der|en|non|tor-||pos=prefix|hard, difficult, wrong, bad}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*tuz-||hard, difficult, wrong, bad}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dus-||bad, ill, difficult}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|zur-||mis-|pos=prefix}}, {{cog|got|𐍄𐌿𐌶-||hard, difficult|pos=prefix}}, {{cog|grc|δυσ-||pos=prefix|bad, ill, difficult}}. More at {{l|en|dys-}}.

